    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are delighted to offer for sale this excellent detached family residence in turn-key condition with tranquil surroundings & abundance of outdoor space.\n\nSituated on a beautifully landscaped site in the scenic Corboley locale, the property offers a peaceful setting whilst still being well positioned within close proximity to Barna Village, as well as easy access to Moycullen, Salthill & Galway City.\n\nOriginally constructed in 1988, the house has been well maintained & upgraded over the years and is excellently presented by current owners with a contemporary open-plan living space, abundance of accommodation & a quality B energy rating.\n\nNatural light is in abundance throughout the home. Centrally positioned on site, the house is encompassed by the beautiful surroundings and allows the home to avail of the southerly & westerly aspects.\n\nNeatly laid out & arranged over one storey, the bungalow residence offers substantial accommodation of approximately 227.7 sq.m.\n\nUpon entry, the reception spaces are arranged between a large front living space with inserted stove, adjacent open-plan kitchen-dining area, a separate utility space and a thoughtfully positioned corner sunroom availing of the south-westerly aspect.\n\nFive sizeable bedrooms comprise the remainder of the house, along with a main family bathroom. Each bedroom consists of impressive space all suitable as double bedrooms, whilst two avail of their own en-suites.\n\nFurthermore, the property boasts a large attic space covering the entirety of the residence offering an impressive amount of storage & potential (STPP).\n\nExternally, the property is equally impressive, positioned on approximately 0.31 hectares/0.77 acres. The front of the home offers ample off-street parking with tarmac driveway, whilst the grounds are encompassed by mature & manicured greenery. A separate timber shed is positioned at the rear of the home that offers additional storage & a variety of uses ideally suited for a family home.\n\nAdjacent to the kitchen-dining area is an ideally positioned patio space, perfect for outdoor hosting & further example of the thoughtful design allowing the area to take advantage of the surroundings as well as the south-westerly aspect.\n\nSituated in the Corboley area of Galway, the residence offers a peaceful & tranquil position with beautiful rural surroundings whilst still being ideally positioned for all amenities & services, as well as close proximity to local primary schools.\n\nThe property is within close proximity to the popular Barna Village, as well as easy access to Moycullen, Galway University, Salthill & Galway City.\n\nPopular outdoor landmarks are nearby including Barna Golf Club, Silver Strand, Barna Woods & Cappagh Fields.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a beautiful family home with spacious accommodation, turn-key quality in a tranquil environment, whilst still being able to avail of all amenities & services of nearby Barna Village, Galway City & surrounding areas.\n\nViewing is highly recommended & guaranteed not to disappoint.\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database For Further details please contact our office on 091-564212 OFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PMProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie NOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
